            <div xml:id="d694">

                <pb facs="1564" n="1548" sameAs="frus:frus1951v01/pg1548"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">394.31/11–3051: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Bruce</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-11-30T17:00:00+01:00">November 30,
                            1951—5 p. m</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3240. Deptel 3194, Nov 27 communicated to
                        FonOff by note today. Only immediate
                    reaction was comment that French wld probably request consultation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bruce</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
